 berries of your choosing. <br>Ideal as either a snack between meals, or as <br> a dessert after dinner!","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":96,"type":1,"name":"Orange Juice","image":"OrangeJuice.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":20,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A juice for those who love the taste of oranges.","category":16,"warm":0},{"id":97,"type":2,"name":"Cheap Stout Beer","image":"darkBeer.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":5,"price":0.05,"description":"A cheaper stout beer enjoyed primarily by 2nd and 3rd Class Passengers<br>who are on a tight budget. There's plenty to go around!","category":18,"warm":10},{"id":98,"type":3,"name":"Hand Made Old Reds Cigarettes","image":"handMadeOldReds.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":-3,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"&quot;Smoke 'em if you've got 'em, I say!&quot; -Customer <br>Testimony from a Mr. Max Seidelmann of Philidelphia, PA.","category":24,"warm":0},{"id":99,"type":1,"name":"Pantry Made Coffee","image":"CabinetBlendCoffee.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":10,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Coffee brewed in the pantry for the enjoyment <br>of the ship's crew. Try not to <br>use the expensive blends!","category":15,"warm":20},{"id":100,"type":1,"name":"Pantry Made Tea","image":"EarlGreyTea.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Tea brewed in the pantry for the enjoyment <br>of the ship's crew. Try not to <br>use the expensive blends!","category":14,"warm":20},{"id":101,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Salad","image":"salad.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A salad thrown together in the pantry. Not <br>elegant, but certainly edible and healthy.","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":102,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Meal","image":"meal.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-3,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A most delicious meal, cooked in the pantry.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":103,"type":0,"name":"Choux \u00c0 La Cr\u00e9me","image":"ChouxALaCreme.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":-2,"drunk":0,"price":2.5,"description":"French creme puffs topped with a chocolate <br>drizzle, served with a side of strawberries. <br>A delightful dessert for any sweet tooth!","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":104,"type":0,"name":"Scones","image":"scones.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":-1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Scottish quick bread that is typically covered in <br>a sweet glaze. Sometimes features berries or <br>diced fruit inside.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":105,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Soup","image":"soup.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A soup made in the pantry. Not as fine as the <br>soups served to passengers, but certainly edible.","category":6,"warm":30},{"id":106,"type":1,"name":"Pantry Made Hot Chocolate","image":"HotChocolate.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Hot chocolate brewed in the pantry for crew <br>consumption. Perfect for warming up after trips <br>down to the refrigerated holds.","category":17,"warm":20},{"id":107,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Toast","image":"ToastWithRaspberryJam.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Toast made in the pantry. About as plain and <br>simple as toast always is.","category":6,"warm":0},{"id":108,"type":1,"name":"Pantry Made Cappuccino","image":"Cappuccino.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":10,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A cappuccino made in the pantry. sometimes, <br>you just need that extra kick to stay <br>awake until your shift ends...","category":15,"warm":20},{"id":109,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Pudding With Berries","image":"puddingWithBerries.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":-1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Pudding with berries, whipped up in the pantry. <br>A light and fairly inexpensive dessert that is perfectly <br>acceptable for the ship's crew to eat.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":110,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Rice with Meat","image":"rice_with_meat.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-5,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Rice with meat, made in the pantry. A little <br>more sloppy than the passenger's meals, but <br>just as delicious.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":111,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Fitness meal","image":"meat.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":-2,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A lightweight meal made in the pantry. Hey - even <br>the ship's crew has to watch their weight sometimes, too!","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":112,"type":1,"name":"Pantry Stored Pepsi Cola","image":"PepsiCola.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":25,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A Pepsi Cola, stored in the pantry. No one <br>will notice if you take this, right...?","category":13,"warm":0},{"id":113,"type":1,"name":"Pantry Stored Dr Pepper","image":"DrPepper.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":25,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A Dr Pepper, stored in the pantry. No one <br>will notice if you take this, right...?","category":13,"warm":0},{"id":114,"type":1,"name":"Pantry Stored Coca Cola","image":"CocaCola.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":25,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A Coca Cola, stored in the pantry. No one <br>will notice if you take this, right...?","category":13,"warm":0},{"id":115,"type":1,"name":"Pantry Stored Schweppes Indian Tonic Water","image":"SchweppesIndianTonicWater.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":20,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Schweppes Indian Tonic Water, stored in the <br>pantry. No one will notice if you take <br>this, right...?","category":13,"warm":0},{"id":116,"type":1,"name":"Pantry Stored Schweppes Lemonade","image":"SchweppesLemonade.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":20,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Schweppes Lemonade, stored in the pantry. No <br>one will notice if you take this, right...?","category":13,"warm":0},{"id":117,"type":0,"name":"Lamb with Mint Sauce","image":"lamb.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-2,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Lamb. Rare, with very little mint sauce. <br>You like that, don't you?","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":118,"type":0,"name":"Sirloin of Beef","image":"beef.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-2,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Deliciously roasted sirloin of beef, a staple <br>of the 1st Class Dining Saloon. No voyage <br>is complete without having this at least once!","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":120,"type":0,"name":"\u00c0 la Carte Cr\u00e9me Cupcake","image":"carteCremeCupcake.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":7,"description":"A gourmet cupcake filled with rich creme <br>and topped with fluffy strawberry icing. <br>Made specially for the \u00c0 la Carte Restaurant.","category":11,"warm":0},{"id":121,"type":0,"name":"Oatmeal","image":"oatmeal.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A bowl of oatmeal, filled with berries: an <br>iconic breakfast food that also functions <br>surprisingly well as an afternoon snack.","category":6,"warm":0},{"id":122,"type":0,"name":"Yogurt With Berries","image":"Yogurt.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Creamy yogurt with an assortment of berries for <br>your mixing pleasure. The ultimate lightweight <br>snack or dessert for the health conscious.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":123,"type":0,"name":"Caramel Sundae","image":"caramelSundae.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A sundae of vanilla ice cream soaked in <br>fine caramel sauce.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":124,"type":0,"name":"Cherry Sundae","image":"cherrySundae.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A sundae with a cherry flavored sauce, topped <br>with a fresh cherry.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":125,"type":0,"name":"Very Vanilla Sundae","image":"veryVanillaSundae.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A sundae of mixed vanilla ice cream, topped with <br>a swirl of whipped cream.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":126,"type":0,"name":"Mint Sundae","image":"mintSundae.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A mint flavored sundae, topped with chocolate <br> sauce and whipped cream.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":127,"type":0,"name":"Oysters","image":"oysters.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":10,"description":"Steamed oysters prepared with lemon juice and garlic. <br>So fresh, they still taste of the sea!","category":7,"warm":0},{"id":128,"type":0,"name":"Waldorf Pudding","image":"waldorfPudding.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A rich whipped pudding with grapes and slices <br>of apple mixed within.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":129,"type":0,"name":"Baked Haddock","image":"bakedHaddock.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-2,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A beautiful baked haddock that is a staple of <br>the 2nd Class Dining Saloon. ","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":130,"type":0,"name":"Rice Stew","image":"riceStew.png","hungry":35,"thirsty":1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Stew primarily made of rice with some vegetables <br> and meat mixed in.","category":5,"warm":30},{"id":131,"type":0,"name":"Roast Beef","image":"roastbeef.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"The most popular item on the 3rd Class Menu, <br>this roast beef is as delicious as it is filling!","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":132,"type":0,"name":"Gruel","image":"gruel.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":-1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Certainly no one's first choice, but sometimes, <br>you just don't have any other options...","category":6,"warm":0},{"id":133,"type":1,"name":"Hot Tea","image":"EarlGreyTea.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A cup of hot tea, brewed by the Carpathia's crew. <br>It's warm, but doesn't make the pain go away...","category":14,"warm":20},{"id":134,"type":1,"name":"Hot Coffee","image":"CabinetBlendCoffee.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":10,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A cup of hot coffee, brewed by the Carpathia's crew. <br>It's warm, but doesn't make the pain go away...","category":15,"warm":20},{"id":135,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Oatmeal","image":"oatmeal.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A bowl of oatmeal, made in the pantry. <br>Quick to make and quick to eat, this <br>is the food of choice for a busy worker.","category":6,"warm":0},{"id":136,"type":0,"name":"Helping rice","image":"rice.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":-5,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Rice meant to accompany a grand entr\u00e9e that will <br>never come...","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":137,"type":1,"name":"Water","image":"water.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":30,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Ice cold water: just about the last thing <br>you want to think about right now...","category":13,"warm":0},{"id":138,"type":0,"name":"Carpathia Stew","image":"carpathiaStew.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A hot stew made by the Carpathia Crew <br>for the survivors of the Titanic disaster. <br>Doesn't taste like much of anything...","category":6,"warm":30},{"id":139,"type":1,"name":"Hot Chocolate","image":"HotChocolate.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A cup of hot chocolate made by the Carpathia Crew. <br> Doesn't do much to lift the spirits.","category":17,"warm":20},{"id":140,"type":2,"name":"Whiskey Sour","image":"whiskeySour.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":5,"drunk":13,"price":5,"description":"Bourbon Whiskey mixed with sugar and <br> lemon or lime juice to offer a sour twist. ","category":19,"warm":10},{"id":141,"type":2,"name":"Lime Margarita","image":"limeMargarita.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":5,"drunk":12,"price":5,"description":"A margarita mixed with fresh lime juice <br>and tequila. Very sour and flavorful!","category":19,"warm":6},{"id":142,"type":2,"name":"Rum and Cola","image":"rumCoke.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":5,"drunk":15,"price":5,"description":"A classic mixture of Rum and cola that <br>is both sweet and highly alcoholic. ","category":19,"warm":10},{"id":143,"type":2,"name":"Mojito","image":"mojito.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":5,"drunk":13,"price":5,"description":"A traditional Cuban drink consisting of rum, <br>sugar, lime, soda water, and mint leaves.","category":19,"warm":6},{"id":144,"type":0,"name":"Strawberry Sundae","image":"strawberrySundae.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A sundae with a strawberry flavored sauce, topped <br>with fresh strawberries.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":145,"type":0,"name":"Chocolate Sundae","image":"chocolateSundae.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Chocolate ice cream covered in chocolate <br>sauce, topped with a cherry.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":146,"type":2,"name":"Red Russian","image":"redRussian.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":5,"drunk":15,"price":5,"description":"A classic Russian blend of cranberry juice and <br>vodka with a hint of lime. Heavily alcoholic.","category":19,"warm":6},{"id":147,"type":0,"name":"Omelette","image":"omelette.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":-1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A made to order omelette created with delicious <br> eggs, fresh vegetables, and gourmet cheese.","category":6,"warm":0},{"id":148,"type":0,"name":"Waffles and Ice Cream","image":"wafflesIceCream.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Waffles topped with freshly whipped ice cream <br> and chocolate sauce. The ideal breakfast for those <br>with a keen love of dessert foods.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":149,"type":1,"name":"After Dinner Viennese Blend Coffee","image":"AfterDinnerVienneseBlendCoffee.png","hungry":5,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A strong, full bodied dark roast. Perfect <br>European style after dinner coffee that is <br>said to go well alongside dessert.","category":15,"warm":20},{"id":150,"type":0,"name":"Croissant","image":"croissant.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":-2,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A crescent shaped pastry that is well known <br>for its buttery and flaky exterior.  Can <br>be eaten plain, or with toppings.","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":151,"type":0,"name":"Lemon Pudding","image":"lemonPudding.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":-1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A lemon flavored pudding that is a simple<br>and yet delicious snack or dessert item.<br>Sour and a little bit sweet.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":152,"type":1,"name":"Perrier's Sparkling Mineral Water","image":"perrierWater.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":40,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Known to many as 'The champagne of table waters'. <br>Perrier's sparkling mineral water is a commonplace item<br>at tables of the upper class.","category":13,"warm":0},{"id":153,"type":1,"name":"Pantry Made Cocoa","image":"Cocoa.png","hungry":2,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A hot and rich flavored cocoa, made in the pantry. <br>Topped with whipped cream, this drink is ideal<br> for crewmen with a sweet tooth.","category":17,"warm":20},{"id":154,"type":3,"name":"Officer's Stock Cigar","image":"partagas_seriednr4.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":-3,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A cigar from a complimentary supply set<br> aside for the ship's Captain and officers.<br> One of the perks of service!","category":22,"warm":0},{"id":155,"type":2,"name":"Sherry","image":"sherry.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":1.5,"description":"A fortified wine that is often rather dry, though <br>sweet variants exist. Has a savory flavor that<br> is best enjoyed alongside a hearty meal.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":156,"type":2,"name":"Martini","image":"martini.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":7,"drunk":10,"price":5,"description":"A very popular cocktail made with gin and vermouth, garnished<br>with an olive. Said to have originated in Italy around 1863,<br> though there is no direct proof of this claim.","category":19,"warm":6},{"id":157,"type":0,"name":"Mousse Au Chocolat","image":"mousse.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A traditional French recipe, Mousse Au Chocolat <br> is a delectable dessert item enjoyed around the world. <br> Made with the finest French chocolate! ","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":158,"type":0,"name":"Potatoes and Green Peas","image":"potatoesPeas.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A side of mashed potatoes topped with a <br> generous serving of green peas. The perfect <br> compliment for any meal!","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":159,"type":0,"name":"American Ice Cream","image":"americanIceCream.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"American styled ice cream, commonly served in <br> 2nd Class. Comes in vanilla or chocolate, with <br> or without fudge and whipped cream.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":160,"type":0,"name":"Spring Lamb","image":"2ndLamb.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Fresh lamb chops seasoned with mint sauce. <br> An elegant offering for those seeking a <br> sophisticated meal fitting of a 2nd Class businessman.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":161,"type":0,"name":"Chicken and Strips of Potato","image":"chicken.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Grilled chicken served alongside strips of potato. <br> A classic meal that is sure to please.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":162,"type":0,"name":"Bullion","image":"bullion.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":5,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A French dish consisting of broth mixed with <br>meat and vegetables. Similar to soup.","category":6,"warm":30},{"id":163,"type":1,"name":"Chamomile And Lavender Tea","image":"LavenderTea.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"An aromatic blend of Chamomile and Lavender. <br> Perfect for soothing the nerves and allowing<br> one to enjoy the simple things in life.","category":14,"warm":20},{"id":164,"type":1,"name":"La Tisane","image":"LaTisane.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"A French herbal tea made from infusion of <br>herbs and spices. Provides great health benefits.","category":14,"warm":20},{"id":165,"type":1,"name":"Chocolat Chaud","image":"ChocolatChaud.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"A French variant of Hot Chocolate. More <br> thick than western variants. Some <br>equate it to drinking melted chocolate.","category":17,"warm":20},{"id":166,"type":1,"name":"Caf\u00e9 Vanille","image":"CafeVanille.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"French Vanilla Coffee. It was named by<br> perfume and specialty product companies for its aroma.","category":15,"warm":20},{"id":167,"type":1,"name":"Limonade","image":"Limonade.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":20,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"French Lemonade, made far more sour than<br> it is sweet. Cold and refreshing!","category":13,"warm":0},{"id":168,"type":0,"name":"Croissaint \u00c0 la Fraise","image":"CroissantFraise.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"A strawberry flavored Croissant baked specially<br> for Train Transatlantique's train No. 317.","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":169,"type":0,"name":"Omelette Francaise","image":"OmeletteFrancaise.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":-1,"drunk":0,"price":1,"description":"A traditional French Omelette made by <br>authentic French chefs. Quite distinct from <br>Western variants.","category":6,"warm":0},{"id":170,"type":0,"name":"Cr\u00e9pe aux Bananes et Chocolat","image":"BananeCrepe.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1.5,"description":"A Crepe topped with slices of banana <br>and a rich and creamy chocolate sauce.<br>Practically like eating dessert for breakfast!","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":171,"type":0,"name":"Pain Perdu","image":"FrenchToast.png","hungry":35,"thirsty":-1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"More commonly known as French Toast. Pain <br>Perdu is made by frying bread soaked in egg and milk.<br>Topped with syrup and butter.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":172,"type":0,"name":"Eggs","image":"Eggs.png","hungry":35,"thirsty":-1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Eggs, served scrambled, fried, or sunny s