d<br>a little too much helping rice in their lives.","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":207,"type":0,"name":"Pommes Chateau","image":"pommesChateau.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":5,"description":"A special French cut of potatoes. Crispy around the<br>edges and saut\u00e9ed  in butter. Seasoned with parsley.<br>A more elegant side dish than helping rice or noodles.","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":208,"type":0,"name":"Spaghetti with Pesto","image":"pesto.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-3,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Spaghetti served with a pesto sauce instead of a<br>tomato sauce. A delicious alternative to those with<br> an aversion to tomatoes.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":209,"type":0,"name":"Raspberry Petit G\u00e2teau","image":"raspberryMinicake.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1.5,"description":"A French 'small cake', topped<br>with a sweet raspberry creme icing and fresh raspberries.","category":11,"warm":0},{"id":210,"type":0,"name":"Risotto","image":"risotto.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":5,"description":"A rice dish cooked in broth until it develops<br>a creamy consistency. Often contains meat, fish, or vegetables.<br>Typically a side dish, but can be served as an entr\u00e9e.","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":211,"type":0,"name":"Salmon Mayonnaise","image":"salmon.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Fresh cooked salmon, straight off the grill.<br>Topped in a special mayonnaise sauce.<br>Has a distinctly lemon like aftertaste.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":212,"type":0,"name":"Souffle Grand Mariner","image":"souffle.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":5,"description":"A souffle baked with a large quantity of delicious<br>brandy based orange liqueur. Topped with powdered sugar.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":213,"type":0,"name":"Broiled Shrimp","image":"shrimp.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Broiled shrimp served alongside a tangy dipping sauce.<br>Tast