ith<br>a buttery glaze and flavorful seasonings.","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":221,"type":0,"name":"Plum Pudding","image":"plumPudding.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A traditional English dessert typically made in the early Advent<br>a year prior to when it is served. ","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":222,"type":0,"name":"Jacket Potato","image":"jackPotato.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Crispy on the outside with a steaming hot melted center, Jacket<br>Potatoes are a common side dish enjoyed by Titanic's First Class.","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":223,"type":0,"name":"Peaches in Chartreuse Jelly","image":"peachesChartreuseJelly.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A blend of diced peaches and Chartreuse Liqueur served in a<br>delectable gelatin mixture. Topped with creme and<br> a light dusting of sugar.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":224,"type":2,"name":"Brandy Flask","image":"flask.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":5,"drunk":15,"price":0,"description":"A flask filled with warm, refreshing brandy. It<br>will certainly give you the kick you need, but<br>be careful not to over indulge!","category":21,"warm":10},{"id":225,"type":0,"name":"Emergency Hardtack","image":"cabinBiscuit.png","hungry":10,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Small, long lasting biscuits often used by sailors during<br> emergencies at sea. There's no need to worry about these spoiling on you, so.<br>just pray that there's enough to feed everyone until rescue arrives...","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":226,"type":0,"name":"Bread and Butter","image":"breadAndButter.png","hungry":10,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Sliced bread with melted butter resting atop.<br>Quite a plain side item. Do you really need<br> any clever and witty comments about this one?","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":227,"type":0,"name":"Cereal","image":"cereal.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A cl