:1,"name":"Peach Juice","image":"peachJuice.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Freshly squeezed peach juice. Not exactly a traditional drink, but<br>still loved by fanatics of peaches.","category":16,"warm":0},{"id":317,"type":0,"name":"Chocolate Cupcake","image":"chocolateCupcake.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"A chocolate cupcake with chocolate icing and half a bar of<br>imported French chocolate stuck into the icing. Very<br>rich in chocolate - almost sickeningly so! ","category":11,"warm":0},{"id":318,"type":0,"name":"French Roast Chicken","image":"frenchRoastChicken.png","hungry":35,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":5,"description":"A French Roast Chicken, cooked with delectable lemon<br>juice and fresh French herbs.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":319,"type":0,"name":"Foie Gras","image":"foieGras.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":20,"description":"A specially flattened duck liver that is an exotic specialty<br>dish served in upper class French venues.","category":7,"warm":0},{"id":320,"type":0,"name":"Sole Special","image":"soleSpecial.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":10,"description":"A high quality local catch from expert fishermen<br> in the area. The Sole Special consists of fresh<br>Snapper cooked in a champagne and pesto sauce.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":321,"type":0,"name":"Salmon with Sorrel Sauce","image":"salmonSorrelSauce.png","hungry":35,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":15,"description":"Freshly caught salmon grilled with a Sorrel Sauce.<br>Another of the Hotel France's specialty dishes.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":322,"type":0,"name":"Chateaubriand Steak","image":"chateaubriand.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":15,"description":"A sirloin steak commonly served alongside chateaubriand sauce.<br>Likely named after Fran\u00e7ois-Ren\u00e9 de Chateaubriand, a famed<br>French writer, politician, and food enthusiast.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":323,"type":0,"name":"Porcini Consomm\u00e9","image":"porciniConsomme.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":2.5,"description":"A clear consomme with slices of Porcini mushroom and beef.<br>Perfect as an appetizer or main course.","category":6,"warm":30},{"id":324,"type":0,"name":"Bouillabaisse","image":"bouillabaisse.png","hungry":35,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1.5,"description":"A fisherman's stew made with mixed vegetables and fresh fish,<br> mussels, and crabs caught in the seas just outside of town. ","category":5,"warm":30},{"id":325,"type":0,"name":"Escargot","image":"escargot.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":15,"description":"A French delicacy, Escargot is made of cooked land snails<br>coated in a garlic-butter sauce.","category":7,"warm":0},{"id":326,"type":0,"name":"Savarin","image":"savarin.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"A ring cake soaked in liquer syrup and topped with <br>fresh berries and sliced fruit.","category":11,"warm":0},{"id":327,"type":0,"name":"Gourmet Cupcake","image":"gourmetCupcake.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1.5,"description":"A gourmet French cupcake, topped with delicious swirls of French creme<br>and a fresh strawberry.","category":11,"warm":0},{"id":328,"type":0,"name":"Millefeuille","image":"millefeuille.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"Three layers of puffed pastry alternating with layers of cr\u00e9me<br>and a glazing of vanilla icing.","category":11,"warm":0},{"id":329,"type":0,"name":"Layer Cake","image":"layerCake.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1.5,"description":"A rich chocolate layer cake baked fresh daily<br> in the Caf\u00e9 Frei.","category":11,"warm":0},{"id":330,"type":0,"name":"Four Quarters Cake","image":"frenchPoundCake.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1.5,"description":"A French take on the famed British pound cake. Earns it's<br> name from the fact that all four ingredients <br>used to make it are used in equal quantities.","category":11,"warm":0},{"id":331,"type":0,"name":"Vanilla Cr\u00e9me Wafers","image":"cremeWafers.png","hungry":10,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"Wafers wrapped around rich and authentic French vanilla cr\u00e9me.<br>A delicious and relatively low fat dessert choice.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":332,"type":0,"name":"Chocolate Dipped Ice Cream","image":"chocolateDippedIceCream.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1,"description":"A cone of vanilla ice cream, dipped in a chocolate sauce and<br>topped with fresh nuts.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":333,"type":0,"name":"French Vanilla Ice Cream","image":"frenchVanillaIceCream.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1,"description":"Differs from plain vanilla ice cream in that the base for French Vanilla<br>Ice Cream has egg yolks mixed in to give it a distinct flavor.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":334,"type":0,"name":"Peppermint Ice Cream","image":"peppermintIceCream.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1,"description":"Minty Ice Cream topped with a peppermint sauce.<br>An unusual and slightly addictive flavor.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":335,"type":0,"name":"Mixed Berry Sundae","image":"mixedBerrySundae.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A Sundae consisting of cherry flavored ice cream with various<br>mixed berries and berry juices blended in.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":336,"type":0,"name":"Roast Beef","image":"roastbeef.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-1,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Delicious roast beef that has been cooking in the<br>galley's slow cookers all day.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":337,"type":2,"name":"Cellar Stored Champagne","image":"champagne.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":10,"price":0,"description":"Champagne stored in the Wine Cellar. Probably not meant<br>to be drank down here, but hey - you had to climb down so many stairs<br> to get here, so you might as well make the trip worthwhile!<br>A favorite recommendation of Lady Edson and her friend, Dave.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":338,"type":2,"name":"Cellar Stored Wine","image":"wine.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":0,"description":"Wine taken from one of the bottles stored in the<br>Wine Cellar. Probably meant to be served in official capacity<br>to passengers, but really, will anyone notice if a little goes missing?<br>Just look at how many bottles there are in here!","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":339,"type":2,"name":"Cellar Stored Sherry","image":"sherry.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":0,"description":"A sherry, stored within the ship's Wine Cellar.<br>This fortified wine is best served with dessert. Since this<br>place is out of the realm of meal service, however, just enjoy the<br>lovely, lovely sherry on its own!","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":340,"type":2,"name":"Cellar Stored Port","image":"port.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":0,"description":"A port stored in the Wine Cellar. This fortified red wine<br>is sweet and best enjoyed alongside an equally sweet<br>dessert. Since any steward you summon to deliver <br>you dessert would be more likely to escort you away, you'll just have make do.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":341,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Pommes Chateau","image":"pommesChateau.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Mr. Gatti permits his staff to indulge in a limited quantity<br>of the Restraurant's fine ingredients to make themselves meals throughout<br>the day. Just one of the perks of service - enjoy!","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":342,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Consomm\u00e9 Madrilene","image":"consommeMadrilene.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A consomm\u00e9 served up cold, made with red peppers and<br> tomatoes. Mr. Gatti has permitted his staff to eat any excess<br>soup from the prior day's service during their breaks.","category":6,"warm":0},{"id":343,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Stored Macarons","image":"Macarons.png","hungry":5,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"There's crates filled with Macarons in the Food Stores below decks.<br>Mr. Gatti doesn't mind if you take one or two should you<br>grow hungry on service, so long as it does not disrupt your duties!","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":344,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Madeleines","image":"madeleines.png","hungry":5,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A small sponge cake originating from the<br> Lorraine region of Northeastern France. Mr. Gatti<br>has permitted his staff to eat any excess Madeleines<br>baked up by his staff.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":345,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Made Grilled Salmon","image":"grilledsalmon.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-3,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Not all of the salmon that enters the restaurant meets the chef's<br>standards. The meat that doesn't is cooked up for the staff<br>to indulge in during the day.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":346,"type":2,"name":"Bar Stored Beer","image":"beer.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":2,"drunk":2,"price":0,"description":"Who's gonna notice if you pour a tiny bit of this for yourself?<br>So long as you don't get yourself drunk, you can<br>still carry out your duties.","category":18,"warm":4},{"id":347,"type":2,"name":"Bar Stored Champagne","image":"champagne.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":2,"drunk":3,"price":0,"description":"This is definitely NOT meant for crew consumption.<br>Still, you should taste a little of it yourself. Make sure<br>it's not gone bad. Yeah. That's a good excuse!","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":348,"type":2,"name":"Bar Stored Wine","image":"wine.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":3,"drunk":2,"price":0,"description":"A glass of fine wine for passenger's to enjoy. Still, so long as<br>your Superior's don't catch you drinking it, it's okay<br>for you to drink a little, too.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":349,"type":2,"name":"Bar Stored Canadian Club Whiskey","image":"canadianclub.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":2,"drunk":4,"price":0,"description":"Some of the 'good stuff' that the passengers get to sip on every day.<br>You know what? You've worked hard. YOU deserve to sip on a little today!<br>","category":21,"warm":10},{"id":350,"type":0,"name":"Pantry Stored Ice Cream","image":"frenchVanillaIceCream.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"One of the perks of working in the Verandah Caf? or Smoking Room - you get<br>to indulge in some ice cream in the pantry during your downtime. Perfect<br>for a sweet tooth! Just try not to eat too much.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":351,"type":2,"name":"Gatti's Reserve Champagne","image":"champagne.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":10,"price":0,"description":"At the start of each voyage, Mr. Gatti sets aside a small<br>quantity of alcoholic beverages for his staff to enjoy once their<br>shifts have ended.  This special stock has come to be affectionately<br>referred to as &quot;Gatti's Reserve&quot;.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":352,"type":2,"name":"Gatti's Reserve Wine","image":"wine.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":0,"description":"At the start of each voyage, Mr. Gatti sets aside a small<br>quantity of alcoholic beverages for his staff to enjoy once their<br>shifts have ended.  This special stock has come to be affectionately<br>referred to as &quot;Gatti's Reserve&quot;.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":353,"type":2,"name":"Gatti's Reserve Gin","image":"tanqueray.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":15,"price":0,"description":"At the start of each voyage, Mr. Gatti sets aside a small<br>quantity of alcoholic beverages for his staff to enjoy once their<br>shifts have ended.  This special stock has come to be affectionately<br>referred to as &quot;Gatti's Reserve&quot;.","category":21,"warm":6},{"id":354,"type":2,"name":"Gatti's Reserve Beer","image":"beer.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":5,"price":0,"description":"At the start of each voyage, Mr. Gatti sets aside a small<br>quantity of alcoholic beverages for his staff to enjoy once their<br>shifts have ended.  This special stock has come to be affectionately<br>referred to as &quot;Gatti's Reserve&quot;.","category":18,"warm":4},{"id":355,"type":0,"name":"Blueberry Muffin","image":"blueberryMuffin.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"A muffin baked with fresh blueberries. A classic combination that can<br> be enjoyed from bakeries around the world.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":356,"type":0,"name":"Cherry Muffin","image":"cherryMuffin.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"A delicious muffin baked with fresh cherries. Perfect as either dessert<br>or as a tasty breakfast food.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":357,"type":0,"name":"Chocolate Chip Muffin","image":"chocolateChipMuffin.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"A muffin with tiny chocolate chips baked within. Ideal for chocolate<br> lovers who don't want something too rich to eat.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":358,"type":0,"name":"Chocolate Muffin","image":"chocolateMuffin.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.5,"description":"A chocolate muffin, topped with a coat of chocolate sauce. <br>Very rich, sweet, and flavorful in nature.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":359,"type":0,"name":"Kedgeree","image":"kedgeree.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1,"description":"A hearty English breakfast dish consisting of boiled rice, fish, hard<br>boiled eggs, and assorted seasonings. No better way to start the day!","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":360,"type":0,"name":"Kippers","image":"kippers.png","hungry":35,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1,"description":"A dish consisting of a whole herring that is smoked and either salted or pickled.<br>A famous traditional breakfast dish in Great Britain.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":361,"type":0,"name":"Breakfast Salmon","image":"salmonSorrelSauce.png","hungry":45,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":5,"description":"Salmon, freshly caught and grilled up to serve as part of an<br>elegant English Breakfast.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":362,"type":0,"name":"Breakfast Mackarel","image":"MackarelMousseline.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":1,"drunk":0,"price":3.5,"description":"Mackarel caught and prepared to serve as part of a classic<br>English Breakfast.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":363,"type":0,"name":"Breakfast Haddock","image":"bakedHaddock.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-2,"drunk":0,"price":2,"description":"A baked Haddock, caught and served as part of a spectacular and<br>distinctly English Breakfast.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":364,"type":0,"name":"Breakfast Herring","image":"soleSpecial.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":4,"description":"A whole herring, served as a main course as part of a<br>traditional English Breakfast.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":365,"type":1,"name":"Sarsaparilla","image":"sarsaparilla.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":25,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A soft beverage that evokes the image of the American Cowboy.<br>Made from the smilax ornata plant, this beverage is said to<br>function as a remedy for problems with skin and blood.","category":13,"warm":0},{"id":366,"type":0,"name":"Tomato Soup","image":"tomato_soup.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":2,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A hot and steamy bowl of tomato soup, filled to the<br>brim with vegetables. Delicious, filling, and sure to<br>warm one right up!","category":5,"warm":30},{"id":367,"type":0,"name":"Chicken Noodle Soup","image":"chicken_soup.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":2,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A classic soup consisting of noodles, chicken, and a<br>savory broth. Enjoyed around the world by<br>men and women from all walks of life!","category":5,"warm":30},{"id":368,"type":1,"name":"Chase & Sandborn Coffee","image":"chase_and_sandborn_coffee.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":10,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Founded in 1862 in Boston, Massachusetts, Chase & Sandborn Coffee<br>has become famous around the world for being the first coffee company to<br>ship roasted coffee in sealed tins. A popular blend for the common folk.","category":15,"warm":20},{"id":369,"type":2,"name":"Vogel Lager","image":"vogelLager.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":5,"price":0.35,"description":"A lager brewed in Germany, light bodied and with a<br>strong and distinct flavor, this has become a popular<br>beer across Eastern Europe.","category":18,"warm":10},{"id":370,"type":2,"name":"Dark Ale","image":"darkAle.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":8,"price":0.5,"description":"A very strong and bitter ale that has a higher alcoholic<br>content than most beers.","category":18,"warm":10},{"id":371,"type":2,"name":"Golden Ale","image":"goldenAle.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":8,"price":0.5,"description":"A full bodied sweet and fruity ale that has a higher<br> alcoholic content than most beers.","category":18,"warm":10},{"id":372,"type":2,"name":"Pilsner","image":"pilsner.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":5,"price":1.5,"description":"A pale lager originally brewed in Pilsen, located in the <br>Czech Republic. Now, it is a popular brew that has many different<br>Czech, German, European, and American variations.","category":18,"warm":10},{"id":373,"type":2,"name":"Stout Beer","image":"stoutBeer.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":5,"price":0.3,"description":"A dry Irish stout beer, brewed to be flavorful and light.<br>The perfect accompaniment alongside a big, hearty meal.","category":18,"warm":10},{"id":374,"type":2,"name":"Wheat Beer","image":"wheatBeer.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":5,"price":0.5,"description":"A cloudy beer brewed from a mixture of wheat and<br>barley, said to be among the oldest beer brews<br>in the world. A common and popular choice.","category":18,"warm":10},{"id":375,"type":2,"name":"Local Stout Beer","image":"southamptonStoutBeer.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":5,"drunk":5,"price":0.3,"description":"A stout beer brewed in local breweries in Southampton.<br>Served at many of the town's finest pubs and taverns.<br>Light and flavorful, it's best served alongside appetizers and snacks.","category":18,"warm":10},{"id":376,"type":2,"name":"Local Pale Ale","image":"southamptonAle.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":5,"drunk":10,"price":0.5,"description":"A locally brewed pale ale, this strong drink is<br>a favorite of workers in Southampton. High in alcohol<br>content, it's sweet flavor is bound to win you over, too.","category":18,"warm":10},{"id":377,"type":2,"name":"Sak\u00e9","image":"sake.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":1.5,"description":"The National Beverage of Japan! Often warmed slightly and served in<br> a small porcelain bottle and special drinking cups called 'sakazuki'.","category":21,"warm":4},{"id":378,"type":2,"name":"Chardonnay","image":"chardonnay.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":2,"description":"Popularized in Burgundy, this dry wine is renowned for its<br>citrus-like blend of apple and lemon.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":379,"type":2,"name":"Sauvignon Blanc","image":"sauvignon.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":2,"description":"Sauvignon Blanc is often described as a grassy wine, known<br>for a refreshing crispness that stems from its high<br>levels of acidity and low amounts of sugar.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":380,"type":2,"name":"Riesling","image":"riesling.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":2,"description":"A Traditionally sweet wine that is well known for<br>its highly aromatic scent and flavor.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":381,"type":2,"name":"Moscato","image":"moscato.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":2,"description":"A light-bodied and sweet Italian wine with a floral<br>aroma and a flavor defined by tropical fruits.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":382,"type":2,"name":"Pink Moscato","image":"pink_moscato.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":2,"description":"Virtually identical to a traditional Moscato, Pink Moscato's one<br>defining difference is that it is created with a hint of Merlot, giving it a distinct<br>ruby red color and hints of strawberry flavor.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":383,"type":2,"name":"Cabernet Sauvignon","image":"cabernet.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":2,"description":"A full-bodied wine with a distinct acidity that gives it<br>a unique flavor profile, particularly when it has been aged.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":384,"type":2,"name":"Merlot","image":"merlot.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":2,"description":"A traditional Bordeaux style French Wine, Merlot is most often a medium-bodied<br>wine that has a strong flavor of fresh fruit with leafy notes.","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":386,"type":0,"name":"Vegetable Casserole","image":"VegetableCasserole.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A tender vegetable casserole made with ample quantities of butter and fresh cheese.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":387,"type":0,"name":"Lamb with Roasted Potatoes","image":"LambWithPotatoes.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Deliciously seared lamb served with a side of lemon glazed potatoes.<br>A simple yet popular meal that the upper class of Ireland <br>frequently indulge in.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":388,"type":0,"name":"Salmon and Red Cabbage","image":"SalmonRedCabbage.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":5,"description":"A sublime cut of salmon served with a side of delectable Irish<br> Red Cabbage, a sophisticated dish for those with a discerning taste.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":389,"type":0,"name":"Lamb Stew","image":"LambStew.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":20,"drunk":0,"price":0.25,"description":"A regular meal of the common folk of Ireland, this stew combines fresh lamb<br>with onion, potato, carrot, parsnip, turnips, and more. This dish<br>is a staple of the Irish country home.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":390,"type":0,"name":"Rabbit and Cider Stew","image":"RabbitStew.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":20,"drunk":0,"price":0.15,"description":"A simple dish that has been served in Irish homes for ages. Rabbit and other<br>vegetables are prepared with apple cider, offering a dry sweetness that<br> lightens the flavor of the rabbit.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":391,"type":0,"name":"Irish Mackerel","image":"IrishMackerel.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.1,"description":"Mackerel is very common around the Irish coast, rendering it an inexpensive<br>fish that is often served at a respectable price in portside cities.<br>As such, it is also commonly served on seafaring vessels as well.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":392,"type":0,"name":"Irish Shepherds Pie","image":"ShepherdsPie.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.25,"description":"A traditional Irish dish consisting of ground lamb and vegetables served under<br>a layer of mashed potatoes and cheese.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":393,"type":0,"name":"Vegetable Stuffed Beef","image":"StuffedBeef.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.1,"description":"Rolls of beef stuffed filled with all manner of seared vegetables. A delicious<br>Irish spin on a more traditional English Roast.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":394,"type":0,"name":"Boxty","image":"PotatoPancakes.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.1,"description":"A traditional Irish potato pancake, consisting of mashed and grated potatoes.<br>The resulting texture is part pancake, part hashed brown.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":395,"type":0,"name":"Vegetable Stew","image":"VegetableStew.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":20,"drunk":0,"price":0.1,"description":"A hearty Irish stew that prominently features potatoes and lentils, with healthy<br>servings of carrots, broccoli, onion, and more mixed in.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":396,"type":0,"name":"Berry Muffin","image":"BerryMuffin.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.15,"description":"A muffin consisting of fresh berries and a light honey glaze, giving it a<br> fruity sweet flavor.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":397,"type":0,"name":"Barmbrack","image":"Barmbrack.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.15,"description":"A traditional Irish quick bread baked with bits of fruit within, often<br>soaked with whiskey or tea overnight to add to the flavor.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":398,"type":0,"name":"Irish Cream Truffles","image":"IrishTruffles.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":0,"drunk":5,"price":0.5,"description":"Truffles filled with a delicious Irish Cream filling. Mildly alcoholic.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":399,"type":0,"name":"Irish Cream Cheesecake","image":"IrishCreamCheesecake.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":0,"drunk":5,"price":0.5,"description":"Cheesecake made with large amounts of Irish Cream to give it an added flavor.<br>Mildly alcoholic.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":400,"type":0,"name":"Rhubarb Fool With Strawberries","image":"RhubarbFool.png","hungry":30,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0.15,"description":"A simple dessert consisting of a whipped custard, rose water, and<br>sugar coated strawberries.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":401,"type":2,"name":"Irish Rum and Cola","image":"rumCoke.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":5,"drunk":15,"price":0.25,"description":"A cheap and affordable rum and cola cocktail served in many Irish pubs.<br>A little lacking in flavor and smoothness, but the patrons<br>who purchase this drink are hardly in a position to judge.","category":19,"warm":10},{"id":402,"type":2,"name":"Irish Whiskey and Soda","image":"whiskeysoda.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":15,"price":0.25,"description":"Certainly does take the chill out of the air. The<br>drink of choice for Lord Charles Lambeth, although<br>he would never be caught drinking such a cheap blend.","category":19,"warm":10},{"id":403,"type":2,"name":"Irish Gin","image":"tanqueray.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":15,"price":0.25,"description":"A cheaper Irish gin, far more affordable to the masses than the<br>infinitely superior in quality Tanqueray brand it aims to mimic.","category":21,"warm":10},{"id":404,"type":2,"name":"Cheap Irish Coffee","image":"IrishCoffee.png","hungry":5,"thirsty":15,"drunk":10,"price":0.25,"description":"Coffee with a distinctly Irish taste. Contains <br>hot coffee, sugar, and cheap Irish Whiskey with <br>a cream topping. Adequate quality for its low price.","category":19,"warm":4},{"id":405,"type":2,"name":"Cheap Irish Whiskey","image":"jameson.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":15,"price":0.25,"description":"An off brand of Jameson whiskey that lacks any of the smoothness of its competitor, but<br>comes at a far more affordable price for most Irish families.","category":21,"warm":10},{"id":406,"type":2,"name":"Irish Cream","image":"canadianclub.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":10,"drunk":15,"price":0.25,"description":"A traditional Irish Cream, a sweet and creamy alcoholic beverage that<br>is a staple in many Irish recipies, in addition to frequently being<br>drank as part of dessert.","category":21,"warm":10},{"id":407,"type":1,"name":"Thompsons Tea","image":"RooibosTea.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A blend that is rising in popularity across Northern Ireland, created by<br>Robert Thompson in Belfast in 1896.","category":14,"warm":20},{"id":408,"type":2,"name":"Whiskey Tea","image":"LyonsTea.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":5,"price":0.25,"description":"A blend of Irish tea and Irish Whiskey, offering a uniquely Irish take<br>on a classic beverage enjoyed around the world. Cheers, mate!","category":19,"warm":20},{"id":409,"type":2,"name":"Brandy Coffee","image":"CafeauLait.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":10,"drunk":5,"price":1.25,"description":"A simple coffee blend intermixed with an ample quantity of brandy to give<br>it the extra kick you need to make it through those really difficult mornings.","category":19,"warm":20},{"id":410,"type":0,"name":"Bard's Ritual Potato","image":"potato.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":2.5,"description":"Baked in the fires of Hades to a golden shine and topped<br> with copious amounts of butter. Said to have gone to hell and back to get them!<br> Functionally and Physically the same as a normal potato, at just a 5000% markup!","category":7,"warm":0},{"id":411,"type":0,"name":"Apple Crumble Cake","image":"AppleCrumble.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A newer style of cake growing popular in low income families. Fresh apples baked<br>with brown sugar and butter are then laid out beneath a layer of <br>crushed streusal and oats","category":11,"warm":0},{"id":412,"type":0,"name":"Pancakes With Chocolate Sauce","image":"PancakesWithChocolateSauce.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Pancakes topped with a light chocolate sauce, offering a slight<br>hint of luxury to a simple morning meal.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":413,"type":0,"name":"Pancakes With Peach Slices","image":"PancakesWithPeaches.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Pancakes topped with slices of peach as opposed to any kind of sauce.<br>Healthier and peachier than any other pancake!","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":414,"type":0,"name":"Cherry Tart","image":"CherryTart.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A simple cherry flavored tart, offering the fresh, juicy flavor<br>of cherry in the form of a simple baked treat.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":415,"type":0,"name":"Stock Pot Stew","image":"stockPotStew.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":10,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A hearty stew of beef and potato slow cooked all day in<br> stock pots on an open flame. Pairs well with Irish Whiskey.<br> Serves as the namesake for the Stock Pot Pub.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":416,"type":3,"name":"Dunhill After Dinner Cigarettes","image":"dunhillAfterDinner.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":-3,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Dunhill cigarettes intended to be smoked by gentlemen in the evening after dinner<br>has been served. Smooth and relaxing flavor to help one unwind.","category":24,"warm":0},{"id":417,"type":0,"name":"Pickles","image":"pickles.png","hungry":10,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A cucumber pickled in brine and vinegar, affording it a sweet & sour<br>flavor. A common healthy snack in Britain and America.","category":8,"warm":0},{"id":418,"type":0,"name":"Sugar Cookie","image":"sugarCookie.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A traditional sugar cookie, popular in England, Ireland, and America.<br>Just like mother used to make!","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":419,"type":0,"name":"Wafer Cookie","image":"waferCookie.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Two wafers with a creamy center filling. Lighter than a sugar cookie, but<br>still every bit as flavorful.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":420,"type":0,"name":"Maple and Browned Butter Pie","image":"mapleButterPie.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Based on the dish that is highly popular in Lancashire, this pie consists of<br>a browned wheat pastry encasing a thick buttery custard, topped<br>with generous amounts of maple syrup.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":421,"type":0,"name":"Butter Cake","image":"butterCake.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A quintessential American dessert that has butter serve as its primary ingredient.<br>Flavorful and filling, just like yer old auntie used to make!","category":11,"warm":0},{"id":422,"type":0,"name":"Vanilla Roll Cake","image":"vanillaRollCake.png","hungry":20,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A vanilla flavored sponge cake, rolled around a generous helping of vanilla icing in<br>a spiral pattern. The end result is a cake that is dry on the <br>outside, but filled with swirled vanilla icing on the inside. How artistic!","category":11,"warm":0},{"id":423,"type":0,"name":"Chocolate and Macadamia Nut Cookie","image":"chocolateMacadamia.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A chocolate cookie with baked in macadamia nuts to offer additional flavor<br>and texture. Delicious!","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":424,"type":0,"name":"Glazed Doughnut","image":"glazedDoughnut.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A cheap yet filling baked pastry enjoyed all around the world<br>What more is there to say? I have had one. You have<br> had one. We have all had one.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":425,"type":1,"name":"Hot Chocolate with Marshmallows","image":"HotChocolateMarshmallows.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Problem: the stewards refuse to serve you the high quality cocoa with cream that<br>the 1st Class passengers enjoy. Solution: ask for a handful of marshmallows...","category":17,"warm":20},{"id":426,"type":0,"name":"Graham Cracker","image":"grahamCracker.png","hungry":5,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Sylvester Graham invented this boring snack staple around 1829. <br>His mission: to save peoples souls from eternal damnation.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":427,"type":1,"name":"1st Class Mealtime Tea","image":"1stClassDinnerTea.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A standard black tea brewed and served to all passnengers who do not request a<br>specific variety of tea with their meals. Exquisitely brewed for<br>the English gentleman or the upper class American.","category":14,"warm":20},{"id":428,"type":1,"name":"\u00c0 la carte Restaurant Tea","image":"restaurantTea.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A special blend of French tea leaves served to passengers in the Restaurant who do not<br>request a specific variety of tea. A cut above your average black tea!","category":14,"warm":20},{"id":429,"type":1,"name":"2nd Class Mealtime Tea","image":"2ndClassDinnerTea.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A standard black tea brewed and served to all passnengers who do not request a<br>specific variety of tea with their meals. Perfectly suitable for<br>the sophisticated folk of 2nd Class.","category":14,"warm":20},{"id":430,"type":1,"name":"3rd Class Mealtime Tea","image":"3rdClassDinnerTea.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A standard black tea brewed and served to all passnengers who do not request a<br>specific variety of tea with their meals. Perfectly tolerable for<br>the common traveler in Steerage.","category":14,"warm":20},{"id":431,"type":0,"name":"Pan Seared Steak","image":"steak.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":-5,"drunk":0,"price":2.5,"description":"A delicious pan seared steak, cooked to your preference and served with a vegetable garnish. <br>Classic. Simple. Delicious.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":432,"type":0,"name":"Classic Roast Chicken","image":"chickenPrincesse.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":2,"description":"Also known as a Sunday Roast in England, this classic roasted chicken features<br>generous amounts of butter and lemon seasoning, vegetable garnish, and<br>sliced potatoes. Quite filling!","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":433,"type":0,"name":"Challah","image":"sodaBread.png","hungry":15,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A special bread of Eastern European origin used in Jewish Cuisine. Titanic is <br>prepared to cater to Jewish passengers with ritually acceptable challah made from<br> dough in which a small portion is set aside as an offering.","category":12,"warm":0},{"id":434,"type":2,"name":"Kosher Wine","image":"wine.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":8,"drunk":8,"price":1.5,"description":"A specially produced wine made in accordance with Jewish Religious law. Titanic takes great pride<br>in following tradition for her Jewish passengers!","category":20,"warm":4},{"id":435,"type":0,"name":"Matzo Ball Soup","image":"matzo.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":2,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A Jewish food made with Matzah Balls - Jewish Soup Dumplings made of matzah meal, eggs, water, and oil.<br>Often served in Chicken Soup. Available upon special request for any Jewish passengers.","category":5,"warm":30},{"id":436,"type":0,"name":"Kosher Chicken","image":"chickenPrincesse.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":2,"description":"A specially prepared chicken made in accordance with Jewish Law.<br> Salted, and with all traces of blood having been removed.<br> Available upon request for any passenger.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":437,"type":0,"name":"Kosher Smoked Salmon","image":"salmonSorrelSauce.png","hungry":45,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":5,"description":"A smoked salmon prepared in accordance with Jewish law. Available upon <br>special request for any passenger.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":438,"type":1,"name":"Wake-Up Juice","image":"wakeUpJuice.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":0,"drunk":-25,"price":5,"description":"A horrifying concoction that only the wisest of the old<br>western bartenders are qualified to make. In about ten<br>minutes, you will be as sober as a priest on Sunday.","category":26,"warm":0},{"id":439,"type":1,"name":"Laudanum","image":"laudanum.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1,"description":"A wildly popular drug since the Victorian era. Laudanum is a tincture of<br> opium containing approximately 10% powdered opium, used to treat a variety of ailments<br>including fevers and pain, inability to sleep, and even the crying of young babies.","category":26,"warm":0},{"id":440,"type":0,"name":"Coughing Pills","image":"coughingPills.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1,"description":"While these won't help to cure that nasty cough which may be plaguing you, they will<br>help to ease it somewhat, helping you feel better, while also mitigating the potential spread of disease!","category":25,"warm":0},{"id":441,"type":1,"name":"Bicarbonate of Soda","image":"bicarbonateSoda.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1,"description":"More commonly known as baking soda, this is a common remedy for cases of indigestion or<br>acid reflux. Just mix it into a cup of water and drink, and sweet relief will soon be yours.","category":26,"warm":0},{"id":442,"type":0,"name":"Aspirin","image":"aspirin.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1,"description":"Commonly used as relief for pain or fevers, Aspirin is one of the most important medications that<br> all passenger vessels are required to carry, as per the Board of Trade Regulations.","category":25,"warm":0},{"id":443,"type":0,"name":"Mothersills Seasickness Remedy","image":"mothersillSeasicknessRemedy.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":1,"description":"ACTS IN THIRTY MINUTES. SURE CURE. MOTHERSILLS, after the most thorough tests, is now officially<br>adopted and recommended by many transatlantic liners.<br>Guaranteed not to contain cocaine, morphine, opium, or any of the coal-tar products.","category":25,"warm":0},{"id":444,"type":1,"name":"Iced Tea","image":"icedTea.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Iced tea truly became popular at the 1904 World's Fair in St. Louis.<br>Due to the intense summer heat, attendees ignored heated beverages and sought out<br>a more cool alternative. Ever since, Americans have enjoyed more and more iced tea every year.","category":14,"warm":0},{"id":445,"type":1,"name":"Iced Tea with Lemon","image":"icedTeaLemon.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"As iced tea becomes more popular in America, how can one improve upon the classic recipe? The answer<br>was quite simple: slice up a lemon and stick them in the beverage to give it an added hint of sourness.","category":14,"warm":0},{"id":446,"type":1,"name":"Iced Tea with Lime","image":"icedTeaLime.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":15,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Commonly referred to as Sweet Lime Iced Tea, this variant is increasingly popular in the American South.<br>Neither too sweet, nor too bitter, this citrusy beverage will have y'all coming back for seconds!","category":14,"warm":0},{"id":447,"type":2,"name":"Sweet Vermouth","image":"vermouth.png","hungry":0,"thirsty":5,"drunk":15,"price":2.5,"description":"Sweet Vermouth, on the rocks with a twist. It reminds you of Rome.<br>In the evening, when the sun lights the buildings...<br>Now, why not toast to world peace?","category":20,"warm":10},{"id":448,"type":0,"name":"Lasagna","image":"lasagna.png","hungry":45,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Made of alternating stacked layers of pasta sheets and other fillings such as<br>meat, vegetables, tomato sauce, mozzarella cheese, and spices. A favorite dish of the<br>Italian Mafia. Definitely not poisoned.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":449,"type":0,"name":"Chowder","image":"chowder.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":2,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A stew that consists of milk or cream thickened with broken up cabin biscuits and<br>a blend of shrimp, potato, and various spices. A vegetable blend can be<br>served upon request, for those with an aversion to shellfish.","category":5,"warm":30},{"id":450,"type":0,"name":"Clam Chowder","image":"clam_chowder.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":2,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"A chowder, made with Caena's homegrown clams. This dish has ever been a staple of<br>coastal New England restaurants, known for the rich and creamy delight it offers.","category":5,"warm":30},{"id":452,"type":0,"name":"Beef Wellington","image":"beefWellington.png","hungry":45,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":5,"description":"The quintessential dish of English Fine Dining, the Beef Wellington consists<br>of a filet steak wrapped in a puff pastry before being baked. Said<br>to have originated from the imperial court in Vienna.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":453,"type":0,"name":"Pan Seared Scallops","image":"scallops.png","hungry":45,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":2.5,"description":"a classic seafood dish served atop a mixed bed of greens, seasoned with<br>fresh lemon and a garlic butter sauce.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":454,"type":0,"name":"Spring Onion Soup","image":"springOnionSoup.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":2,"description":"This simple soup captures the best flavors of early spring: the sweetness<br>of the young Spring onion, and the tenderness of the vibrant spring greens.","category":5,"warm":30},{"id":455,"type":0,"name":"Chicken and Tomato Burrata Salad","image":"chickenSalad.png","hungry":45,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":2.5,"description":"Pan fried chicken breast seasoned with paprika paired with fresh <br>veggies, creamy burrata cheese and dressed in the most amazing <br>balsamic dressing. Simple, filling, and delicious.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":456,"type":0,"name":"Tuna Tartare","image":"tunaTartare.png","hungry":40,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":5,"description":"A French dish consisting of small cubes of tuna resting atop chopped green<br>onions with sesame oil and soy sauce. White chocolate sauce is alternatively<br>available upon request.","category":5,"warm":0},{"id":457,"type":0,"name":"Potato Storeroom Stored Potato","image":"potato.png","hungry":50,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"It reminds you of home.","category":7,"warm":0},{"id":458,"type":0,"name":"Blueberry Sapphire Sundae","image":"blueberryIceCream.png","hungry":25,"thirsty":0,"drunk":0,"price":0,"description":"Homemade vanilla and blueberry ice cream topped with intricate white<br> Persian chocolate. A dish for friends and lovers alike.","category":10,"warm":0},{"id":459,"type":2,"name":"Espresso Martini","image":"espressoMartini.png","hungry":-1,"thirsty":7,"drunk":10,"price":0.25,"description":"A new invention of the Restaurant's head chef, consisting of gin and vermouth<br> mixed with the perfect blend of hot brewed espresso. this drink<br>is being unveiled on the Titanic, and the recipe will be revealed to the public<